                        <Shape>
                            <Polygon POINTS="351 2013 351 2026 1668 2020 1670 2007 1666 1978 1284 1965 1282 1965 1217 1978 1204 1968 1202 1968 1200 1968 1198 1968 1196 1968 1165 1978 1124 1968 1122 1968 1120 1968 1118 1968 1096 1978 1083 1968 1081 1968 1079 1968 1076 1968 1074 1968 1029 1978 659 1970 656 1970 654 1970 652 1970 652 1972 641 1981 565 1970 563 1970 561 1970 559 1970 559 1972 548 1983 455 1983 425 1970 422 1970 420 1970 349 1983 351 2013"/>
                        </Shape>
                        <String CONTENT="rack to be folded and inserted in the skin. After that,"/>
                    </TextLine>

